 "remarks": "Welcome to this beautifully refreshed, move-in-ready 3-bedroom raised ranch, situated on a quiet dead-end street in Norwalk. Thoughtfully updated and custom-finished throughout, this bright and inviting home features fresh paint, updated bathrooms, hardwood floors throughout the first floor, elegant crown molding, decorative trim, classic wainscoting, and thoughtfully designed storage solutions. The updated kitchen offers granite countertops, new tile flooring, a stylish tile backsplash, and new stainless steel appliances. A charming enclosed entry foyer with a practical mudroom area welcomes you into sun-filled living spaces. The dining area opens onto a spacious deck overlooking a fully fenced backyard with a peaceful wooded backdrop, offering privacy and a perfect setting for entertaining. A small garden area adds charm to the backyard. The fully finished lower level with a bathroom offers potential for two additional bedrooms or flexible multigenerational living. Conveniently located minutes from Stew Leonard's, Whole Foods, schools, shopping, and major highways, including I-95, the Route 7 Connector, and Merritt Parkway. A wonderful combination of comfort, character, privacy, and convenience!",
